  "tool": "brain_delegate_task",
  "args": {
    "persona": "Synthesizer",
    "intent": "Analyze the 1243 open loops associated with the AWS microservice analysis mission (mission-1769275601). Synthesize a high-level progress report that includes: 1. A count of microservices analysis tasks that are completed, in-progress, and not yet started. 2. A summary of any identified blockers or recurring issues. 3. An estimated completion percentage for the overall mission."
